Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:15.39,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:18.77,Alternative,,0,0,0,,our report's over, so we'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:27.36,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Attention all high-ranking officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:30.24,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All high-ranking officers, please meet in the main operations room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:59.11,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Team 5 to hangar 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:03.37,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat. Team 5 to hangar 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayday! Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Teron ship is called the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What an ugly ship that is. Not a bit of grace to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is probably on its way here, to Plat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lure it in and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any guarantee they'll come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The planet bombs that turned their planet into a red husk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,were launched here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Then this is a splendid chance for your inferior race,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.41,0:02:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,of differently colored skin, to\Ndemonstrate your loyalty to Gamilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're every bit as loyal to the Empire as pure-blooded Gamilans!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want to see in a great Gamilas soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall expect results. Garle Dessler!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail to our leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I long for those days when I fought for General Domel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the scheduled strike coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Planet bomb 103 will launch shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct for target errors -3.7.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Target sighted. Reflecting Satellite Cannon charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamber pressure rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflecting Satellite Cannon charging complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitting 103.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,103 has been ignited. Angle proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Accelerating at a speed of 17 gat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,103 is on a collision course for planet Teron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we could use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Edgeworth-Kuiper belt object EKB 637\Nhas deviated from its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a planet bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemies within two light-seconds of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're standing in for Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to have another pretty girl around...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop staring. It's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then XO Sanada and Kodai are both off duty now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're at the lab, looking at that Gamilas soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Mori's there too then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This technology is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanomachines comprise this artificial organelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know the composition of its epidermis?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The exterior is composed of soft tektite rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a race of machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Then what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Androids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I already knew that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't say whether they're self-replicating machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,or simply weapons modeled after humanoid life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the XO means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No complaints... Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure there were no survivors aboard the Yukikaze, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're concerned about him. Aren't you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I quite like that about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of them is the android?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like, I dunno...\NA computer human! Or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the way XO Sanada is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything back at Enceladus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You protected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was my mission. Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you know? About the Cosmo Zero that came to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone named Yamamoto, from accounting, piloted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when are you a pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let it slide this time. But if you ever do that again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the optimal course under those conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me transfer to the pilot squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to try and avenge Akio?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no right to decide that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the captain does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A locker this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:07:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she just won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That sure is a stubborn locker...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Kato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, if that pilot hadn't come,\Nit would've been really bad for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they saved our lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck if I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I had planned to avoid all unnecessary combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to get us to Iscandar as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But we cannot allow the continued existence of the Pluto base,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,whose planet bombs have rendered the Earth a wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall destroy that base with everything we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After the Gamilans captured Pluto, they altered its environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now a dwarf planet with oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.02,0:08:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The UN Cosmo Force has analyzed the movement of surface hot spots,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and determined that the base is most likely to be at one of these points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't identify it with certainty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probable that they're using some kind of stealth shield around the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't making this easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a major enemy base. We can expect heavy resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of defense, we have the Wave Motion Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It will only function for twenty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But in theory, it should offer ample protection from enemy positron beams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll launch the fighters before the Yamato breaches their warning zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will act as a decoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to draw away the enemy fleet we're anticipating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fighters will set a course through Nyx's orbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,around Charon, then down low, to search for the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they find it, they will destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Further, after the Yamato breaks through the enemy fleet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and arrives off the coast of Pluto,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it will provide support fire from above, to cover the fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I propose another plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A long-range shot from the Wave Motion Gun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,would destroy the base easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We will not use the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? It's a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Using it would destroy not only the base, but Pluto itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? What's a planet or two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanba...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to the Tactical Officer. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, this will keep the pilots from suffering any losses, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I don't know if the Yamato even needs a fighter squadron...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:10:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We will commence attack on Pluto without the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, you are in charge of the fighter squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I am, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer Kodai will take command of the fighter squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We will lead the operation from the combat bridge's CIC.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokugawa, go to the combat bridge, and look over the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.91,0:10:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... Aren't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamamoto, from accounting. I won't take up much of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamamoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you piloted that Zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he's the pilot squad's ace, but that Kato's a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shima!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can avenge your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can, but that's it.\NTake care of the Yamato for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Navigation Officer Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the mission zone. Please report to the CIC.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a hero of the Second Battle of Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have always admired you as a sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my father in these seas, where they first attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So I agree with your plan to attack Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As Navigation Officer, I swear to make up for the lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer, I realize the mission is about to commence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to speak with you briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, there's something I'd like you all to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a transfer, from accounting to the fighter squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to transfer into the fighter squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Yamamoto. Nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like working twice as hard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Working twice as hard at what, Sugiyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira! You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you Rei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This name is read "Akira."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...\NI didn't realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rei is fine. Everyone calls me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Okita has already approved this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be handling the pilot and fighter end of the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha will take the northern hemisphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo, the southern hemisphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After the descent to Pluto,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll split into groups of two, to start the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamamoto. You'll be in Alpha, with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you have lost\Nfamily and friends to enemy attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But do not consider dying\Nto avenge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back alive. That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to speak with me about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's okay. No need to anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lt. Kato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was impressed by your work on Enceladus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die out there, Yamamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.57,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lt. Kodai, go out and avenge Earth for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the mission zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy the Wave Motion Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploying Wave Motion Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Output at eighty percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighters ready for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating Operation M-2. Lower the Hayabusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosmo Zeros Alpha 1 and Alpha 2, you are cleared for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 1, roger. Clear for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 2, roger. Clear for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 1 to all fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain radio silence until target is located. Activate ECM.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Passing through Nyx's orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet...\NIs this really enemy space?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything on the radar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemy ships sighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were frightened of the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this silence feels more threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori, keep a close eye on that radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, if we make it through Charon's orbit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and get Pluto in our sights, all we'd need is the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This operation depends on our ability to work with the fighter squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably an enemy long-range attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they fire from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing any enemy ships. And that wasn't from Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage to deck 3. Wave Motion Shields penetrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Closing bulkheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Inertial control system is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship interior at zero-g.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The attack came from ten o'clock, port side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin evasive maneuvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to port, and move into their blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:18:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers. Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,First shot has hit. Impact confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato is engaging in evasive maneuvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid, Commander Shultz...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I, Ganz,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,never imagined using the planet bomb launch system as a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must consider things from different angles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,On the battlefield, the ability to adapt is always critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,General Domel taught us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's unfortunate that the first strike didn't finish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A hunt is something to be savored, Jarletora.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare reflecting satellites for next volley!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Analysis of the attack's flight path puts this area in their blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They know where the Yamato is.\NThey're sure to strike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain geostationary orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.31,0:19:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think yourselves hidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflecting satellites 7, 13, 28. Deploying reflectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Reflecting Satellite Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same attack as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this supposed to be a blind spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Radar, where did the attack originate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find the launch point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain our position!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't... Propulsion's dropping. I can't control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaking working fluid from the point of impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, land us in the seas of Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, brace for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Landing complete...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we're approaching the Wave Motion Shields' time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One more of those attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Have the ship repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aihara, any word from the fighters?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,May I make a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Persistent bastards...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give them a chance to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready next round from the Reflecting Satellite Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflecting satellites in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflecting Satellite Cannon charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, you have fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this is the end. Farewell, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful energy readings...\NDirectly overhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.86,0:24:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato sinks into the Pluto Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.20,0:24:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, rise...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.66,0:24:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.47,0:24:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Earth await your return. It is their last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the vents! Raise the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.25,0:24:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Target the hidden enemy base,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.34,0:24:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and fire a shot into the aurora-filled skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Sun Sets on Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.76,0:24:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 361 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:23:00.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The unknown calls to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:12.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Does your courage burn to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:15.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}We rush on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:18.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}For everyone to survive together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}For happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:27.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Though there is pain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:35.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}We will not be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:40.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Those who know the beautiful Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:45.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Restore its wonders
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bring it back, bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:52.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The road to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Determined to reach our destination
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:29.41,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1700,2000)}{\pos(1414,840)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:29.41,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1700,2000)}{\pos(1266,1073)}The Trap on All Sides
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:33.23,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fade(500,500)}{\pos(960,1035)}Pluto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:44.24,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Reflecting satellite 4. Deploying reflector.>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:47.12,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Correcting angle +5 degrees.>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:50.16,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Reflecting satellite 8. Deploying reflector.>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:53.08,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Correcting angle +4 degrees.>
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:38.19,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Recharging energy! Quickly!>
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.99,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<40 seconds until energy charging complete.>
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:21.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:28.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:36.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:42.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:47.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.66,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:59.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:24.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:49.50,TS Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\an8\c&H93A4F8&\3c&H9096E8&\fs40\blur3\bord1\pos(1006,300)\frz-15.5}Directly Above
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.58,0:21:50.53,TS Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\an8\c&H93A4F8&\3c&H9096E8&\fs40\blur3\bord1\pos(1006,300)\frz-15.5}Directly Above
